  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Veterinary ambulance for spaying campaigns</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A veterinary ambulance will allow us and the other non profits in the area that focus on animal rescue to spay dogs and cats in more remote areas, which in turn will decrease abandonment of dogs and cats that die on the streets either by illness, accidents or in the hand of people.  Asociatia Dumbrava lui Patrocle plans to offer spaying campaigns in Cluj county and in the nearby counties, in partnerships with vets and active animal rescue non profits.</narrative>
  </description>
